  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "File-format foundation: streaming FASTA, FASTQ, SAM, VCF, and BAM readers and writers; gzip detection; BGZF block compression; the binary BAM wire format over the shared SAM record model; BAI index construction, serialization, and .bai sidecar I/O; virtual-offset random access and indexed region queries over compressed BAM.",
